<title>USA: Telxon Corp Q4 net falls, includes charge.</title>
<headline>Telxon Corp Q4 net falls, includes charge.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>							     Three Months</p>
<p>							   Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							  1997	   1996</p>
<p>     Total revenues			    $121,740    $144,882</p>
<p>     Net income					 304	 7,276</p>
<p>Earnings per common and common</p>
<p>equivalent share:</p>
<p>     Net income per share			   .02	   .45</p>
<p> Avg shrs					    16,081	16,098</p>
<p>							    Twelve Months</p>
<p>							   Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							  1997	   1996</p>
<p>     Total revenues			    $466,012    $486,469</p>
<p>     Net income (loss)			  (7,059)	16,521</p>
<p>Earnings per common and common</p>
<p>equivalent share:</p>
<p>     Net income (loss) per share		(.44)	  1.00</p>
<p> Average shares				    16,062	16,490</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q4 results include charges of $5.5 million, or $0.22 a share, related to the retirement of the company's chairman, and a charge of $500,000, or $0.02 a share, related to its sale of its former Itronix subsidiary.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
